# handle-drag-shift (h7-plane): the diamond pressed on-centre (grab 0) and
# moved +50,+30 px in 5 px steps (every step hits even one render stale),
# held: h = 2.0, k = -3.6, the camera unchanged, grab-active, the h and k
# rows lit with their rulers out.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1028 670 over 160
wait 300
shot handle-drag-shift
up
